// Integer-only bit-pattern transcription of pinned portable_libm64.cuh
// plm_exp, plm_log and plm_pow (Rust libm 0.2.16). Inputs and outputs are
// ulong IEEE-754 binary64 encodings; no native fp64 arithmetic is used.
// This shared primitive depends on soft_binary64.metalh and remains unverified.
